# Safety

The unit is powered and can move without warning. Observe every safety
message in this manual.

{% callout type="warning" %}
Keep all body parts clear of the unit while it is powered. Moving parts can
cause serious injury.
{% /callout %}

{% callout type="caution" %}
Do not operate the unit outside the temperature range given in the
Specifications chapter.
{% /callout %}

**Indicator lights.** The status light on top of the unit signals its state
through colour and pattern:

{% grid min=120 gap=16 %}
* {% swatch color="#00a000" height=6 /%}

  **Steady green**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Ready for use{% /color %}

* {% swatch color="#e00000" height=6 /%}

  **Steady red**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Stopped — fault{% /color %}

* {% swatch gradient="90deg, #fd7e14, #ffffff, #fd7e14" height=6 /%}

  **Pulsing amber**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Starting up{% /color %}

* {% swatch gradient="90deg, transparent 0%, #e00000 25%, transparent 50%, #e00000 75%, transparent 100%" height=6 /%}

  **Blinking red**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Emergency stop{% /color %}
{% /grid %}

At a glance: {% chip color="#00a000" /%} ready · {% chip color="#fd7e14" /%} busy · {% chip color="#e00000" /%} stop.
